 { White had an open d-file in the online game Carlsen,M - Theodorou,N (2023) . White has many strong moves in this position. Can you find a move that uses one of White's advanced outposts in order to break through? } 1. { -KEY- } Nb6 $1 Nxb6 2. cxb6 { Correct! Now White has the d-file fully open, in addition to a powerful passed pawn on b6. } Ra8 3. Rd8 { From here, the game lasted only a handful of moves: } Kg7 4. Bxh6+ Kxh6 5. Rxf8 Kg7 6. Rdd8 $18 { The rooks double up on the eight rank in this case. Black resigned as he cannot avoid losing at least a piece. } 
